of [Continuation Definition 55.2, (55.4)](FIB_ATOM_RECURSIVE_HOLOGRAPHIC_BOUNDARY_GEOMETRY_CONTINUATION.md):

$$
L_{\mathrm{kill},n}
 =L_{\mathrm{closed},n}
    +2\operatorname{diag}(\mathbf1_{\operatorname{Leaf}(\rho^nu)}).
\tag{119.3}
$$

